      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5fca5df4d58780532024a52b|full_name}: I understand your position, however, my point is that this feature was one of the somewhat highly requested during EAC war. Yet I haven't seen it being talked in any of the developer blogs yet.\nI'm trying to bring light to it again because personally, I consider it one of the \"accessibility\" features, because I have really poor memory. This beta is all about accessibility features after all.",
