  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-08-21T02:03:36.567Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Add small icons next to the instances you've visited in the current game session (until you restart the game).\nSometimes when you're switching between public instances until you find the one you wanna stick with, it may be hard to remember all of the instances you've already visited, so you end up going to the same ones you're already not interested in.\nThis will allow users with poor memory to easier navigate through many instances and help prevent situations like these.",
